  "description": "A from-scratch rich text editor control for Avalonia, built purely on the TextLayout engine. Supports inline formatting, paragraphs, lists, tables (cell merge, nested tables, and HWP-style inline \"treat as character\" tables), images, hyperlinks, HTML/JSON/RTF round-trip, find/replace, undo/redo, CJK IME, a Word-style page view (continuous or fixed paper), and print/PDF page rendering.",
